{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02520","headline":"中书寓直咏雨简褚起居上官学士 · 杨师道","name":"中书寓直咏雨简褚起居上官学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云暗苍龙阙，沈沈殊未开。\n窗临凤凰沼，飒飒雨声来。\n电影入飞阁，风威凌吹台。\n长檐响奔溜，清簟肃浮埃。\n早荷叶稍没，新篁枝半摧。\n兹晨怅多绪，怀友自难裁。\n况复重城内，日暮独裴回。\n玉阶良史笔，金马掞天才。\n高甍通散骑，复道驾蓬莱。\n思君赠桃李，於此冀琼瓌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨师道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}